":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-25T22:39:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T09:14:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123842","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123842","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123842.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123842.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118138.\r\n- Fixes `RuntimeError: function signature mismatch` caused by `godotsharp_variant_as_string`, `godotsharp_variant_as_string_name`, `godotsharp_variant_as_node_path`, and `godotsharp_variant_as_rid` in a proof of concept web export using LibGodot.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI still think that this https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122907 is a proper fix, it removes the interop types entirely which will make maintaining the code easier going forward, but that PR is inactive for a month with a first CI error still not fixed. Seeing the inactivity and its size I decided to make a smaller temporary fix that is easier to review.\r\n\r\nAt first I copied C++ layouts, but after that `godot_array` and `godot_dictionary` triggered the function signature mismatch. After looking into the C# structs, they used `[FieldOffset(0)]` attribute that made the signatures incompatible. That's why the layout for interop structs is from the C# interop and normal structs.\r\n\r\nNo AI used.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123842/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123842/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}